<p>You disperse into a mass of carrion worms, reforming near the target location (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 5, 4, 3, 2</acronym> teleport accuracy).</p><p>If used on a worm mass, you merge with it, moving to it's location, healing you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">248, 334, 401, 458, 508,</acronym> restoring <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">13, 23, 30, 37, 43</acronym> vim, and destroying the mass.</p>